OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny evening
OL,6,Fbrightness will gradually be replaced
OL,7,Fby cloudy skies overnight. A few spots
OL,8,Fof rain then developing by dawn,
OL,9,Fmainly over northern hills. Another
OL,10,Frather mild night ahead with light
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA rather cloudy start but some
OL,14,Fbreaks will develop allowing some
OL,15,Fsunshine. Feeling warm and humid with
OL,16,Fa few spots of rain possible, which
OL,17,Fmay turn heavier later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
