OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FOvernight rain clearing to sunny
OL,7,Fspells and scattered showers Tuesday.
OL,8,FShowers turning more frequent through
OL,9,FWednesday and Thursday, with some
OL,10,Fheavier bursts possible.
